{"videoId":"u2Juz5sQyYQ","title":"Making Smallest Possible Linux Distro (x64)","author":"Nir Lichtman","authorId":"UCAMu6Dso0ENoNm3sKpQsy0g","published":1737210793000,"description":"In this video I will demonstrate how you can setup the most minimal kernel configuration and we will create a very minimal program runner which will run on top of the kernel.\n\nSetup information:\nbasic info about a kernel dev setup: https://github.com/nir9/low-level-learning-resources/tree/master/setups#linux-kernel-dev-setup\nfor making the isoimage you also need to do the following: &quot;apt install genisoimage&quot;\n\nRefs:\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X86_calling_conventions#System_V_AMD64_ABI\nIntel SDM\nhttps://www.lua.org/home.html\n\nSrc: https://github.com/nir9/welcome/tree/master/lnx/very-minimal-shell","viewCount":408851,"lengthSeconds":1663,"watchProgress":116.979941,"timeWatched":1791586352891,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"1W77PdjDLshvgAk3","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"0lezqvRq5mw","title":"Super Rich Chocoflan recipe for a  light and fluffy Dessert! Irresistible creamy it melts in mouth!","author":"VARGASAVOUR RECIPES","authorId":"UCnTzym6VmmyDiVEOnBIFfsg","published":1679686200000,"description":"Super light and fluffy Dessert! Irresistible soft creamy it melts in mouth!\nThis chocoflan recipe is so soft and creamy it melts in mouth, this is the best chocoflan recipe I have made so far, it is just delightfull to eat this choco flan , it is a receta mexicana, this recipe is Mexican chocoflan \n-------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n00:03 sugar &amp; water\n00:24 Pour the caramel into a mould\n00:54 cream cheese\n00:59 condensed milk\n01:20 cream\n01:36 eggs\n02:11 Bake in bain-marie \n02:18 Let it cool down\n02:22 eggs &amp; sugar\n02:42 flour &amp; cacao powder\n03:20 butter without salt\n04:05 Bake in bain-marie\n\nYOU CAN ACTIVATE SUBTITLES AND TRANSLATION\n\nMy friends, if you liked this video, you can help develop the channel:\n\nRate the video! 👍 - I will be very happy and it will help the development of the channel.\n\nWRITE A COMMENT or ask me about the recipe. I will be more than happy to answer you.\n\n📢 You can also share this video with your friends on social media to let them know which dish you want to cook next.\n\nSIGN UP by clicking here to not miss the new videos https://www.youtube.com/c/VARGASAVOUR?sub_confirmation=1 \nActivate the notifications above ↑ by clicking on the bell 🔔 \nALL RECIPES FROM VARGASAVOUR  https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnTzym6VmmyDiVEOnBIFfsg \n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/vargasavourrecipes\">#vargasavourrecipes</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/chocoflan\">#chocoflan</a>","viewCount":25491,"lengthSeconds":314,"watchProgress":30.245994,"timeWatched":1791988080389,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"27uVGBdjNZLuawsD","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
