{"videoId":"Xp5dyqgT1YU","title":"Mysterious Videos That NO ONE Can Explain...","author":"UNREAL REALITY","authorId":"UC--ZWWjLSOfuiatUrdr8lSA","published":1791730842000,"description":"MYSTERIOUS VIDEOS THAT NO ONE CAN EXPLAIN | REACTION\n\nIn today&apos;s video, we&apos;re reacting to some of the most mysterious, unsettling, and downright creepy TikToks currently going viral! From unexplained paranormal activity caught on camera to bizarre celebrity conspiracies no one can explain, these bone-chilling clips will definitely keep you up at night questioning everything!\n\nInside this video, we uncover:\n🤖 Susan Dells eerie robotic viral appearance breakdown\n☁️ A massive &quot;dome cloud&quot; splitting the sky in half like a broke simulation\n🗺️ Suppressed cartography proving there are entire landmasses hidden beyond Antarctica&apos;s ice walls\n👁️ Walmart&apos;s dystopian privacy update quietly collecting biometric fingerprints and facial geometry\n👻 Chilling apparition / paranormal activity caught on camera at a birthday party\n🛸 The classified Alaska Black Pyramid radiating massive underground electromagnetic entity\nPLUS, SO MUCH MORE!\n\nTIMESTAMPS:\n0.00 - Preview Clips\n0:30 - Opening Intro\n0:51 - Unsettling AI Dystopia Warning\n1:52 - The Bizarre &quot;Robot Wife&quot; Susan Dell Conspiracy\n3:08 - Dolly Parton&apos;s Cryptic Toast to Azazel\n4:16 - Britney Spears&apos; Uncanny Social Media Glitch\n5:24 - Kevin Hart Shutting Down a Creepy Encounter\n6:52 - Obvious Matrix Crowd Glitches &amp; NPC Duplication\n7:47 - Disturbing Details in a Book Hiding in Plain Sight\n9:00 - Massive UAP Cloaked Behind a Cloud\n9:54 - The Bizarre &quot;Dome Cloud&quot; Sky Anomaly\n10:36 - Walmart&apos;s Chilling New Biometric Privacy Policy\n11:46 - Disturbing Analog Horror: The Digital God\n13:47 - Alexa Wi-Fi Wall Mapping &amp; Remote Viewing\n14:56 - DARPA&apos;s Classified Super-Soldier Genetic Modification\n16:31 - Strange and Unsettling Creepy Lip Gloss Comes to Life\n17:10 - The 1587 Antique Geography Book Map Anomaly\n19:12 - The Suppressed Anunnaki Flat-Earth Map Breakdown\n20:13 - The Disturbing Tech Future of Animal Translation\n21:40 - The Cursed Air B&amp;B Listing with a Dark History\n22:32 - Terrifying Ghostly Apparition Fading Live on Camera\n23:55 - City Council Meeting Opening with a Cryptic Curse\n26:09 - The Fast-Food Soda Parasite Shock\n27:12 - Auto Shop Worker Replace Live by a Dystopian Robot\n27:46 - The Classified Alaskan Black Pyramid Mystery\n29:52 - David Grusch on Underwater Non-Human ET Bases\n31:54 - Outro &amp; Final Thoughts\n\nWhich clip creeped you out the most? Comment below - if you dare! And don&apos;t forget to like, hype, share and subscribe for more weekly creepy and mysterious videos just like this!\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/creepytiktoks\">#CreepyTikToks</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/disturbingtiktoks\">#DisturbingTikToks</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/mysteriousvideos\">#MysteriousVideos</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/mysterioustiktoks\">#MysteriousTikToks</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/viraltiktoks\">#ViralTikToks</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/scaryclips\">#ScaryClips</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/unexplained\">#Unexplained</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/unrealreality\">#UnrealReality</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/weirdtiktoks\">#WeirdTikToks</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/hiddentruths\">#HiddenTruths</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/questioneverything\">#QuestionEverything</a>\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@UnrealReality_","viewCount":57153,"lengthSeconds":1930,"watchProgress":1805.40361,"timeWatched":1791824328987,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"8gd5uH7KLNRBbOBA","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"-8GmPlhzN9I","title":"The Desktop I Wanted Didn't Exist... So I Built It","author":"Chris Titus Tech","authorId":"UCg6gPGh8HU2U01vaFCAsvmQ","published":1790334916000,"description":"Three years in the making, this is the Linux desktop I use every day. Built around DWM, Quickshell, and a Fedora base, it brings together tiling windows, matching themes, display profiles, Bluetooth, audio, and system updates with minimal dependencies.\n\nI&apos;ll walk through the setup, demonstrate a fresh installation, and show how I configure shortcuts, window rules, and layouts without recompiling DWM. I&apos;ll also explain why I moved from Arch to Fedora and why I&apos;m still using X11.\n\nThis is a personal project in beta, with rough edges still to polish. Take what you like, customize it, or build something of your own.\n\nThanks to CodeRabbit for sponsoring this video.\nhttps://link.christitus.com/coderabbit\n\n00:00 My Custom Linux Desktop\n02:34 Displays\n05:08 System Settings Tour\n07:27 Default Apps and Themes\n09:49 Backend Tools and Tradeoffs\n12:21 Permissions and File Management\n14:44 Updates and Installation\n16:52 Why I Chose Fedora\n19:00 Shortcuts and Screenshots\n21:08 Gaming and Recovery Scripts\n23:19 Tiling and Floating Windows\n25:31 Configuration and Window Rules\n28:21 Three Years of Work\n\n►► Digital Downloads ➜ https://www.cttstore.com/\n►► Patreon ➜ https://www.patreon.com/christitustech\n►► Twitch ➜ https://www.twitch.tv/christitustech\n►► Website and Guides ➜ https://christitus.com/","viewCount":172914,"lengthSeconds":1789,"watchProgress":0.828327,"timeWatched":1791583729896,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"9lnkPj9cEJkNg4Ru","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
