{"videoId":"SqpWNgsR1TM","title":"CyberSecLabs - Lazy - Linux [Walkthrough]","author":"PinkDraconian","authorId":"UCmXwpkCXmIKjoRLMsq9I3RA","published":1596881801000,"description":"▶️ YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/PinkDraconian\n🐦 Twitter: https://twitter.com/PinkDraconian\n🎵 TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@pinkdraconian\nℹ️ LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/robbe-van-roey-365666195/\n📞 Discord: PinkDraconian<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/9907\">#9907</a>\n📷 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/robbevanroey/\n🕸️ Website: http://pinkdraconian.d4rkc0de.com/\n👨‍💻 HackTheBox: https://www.hackthebox.eu/home/users/profile/129531 Twitter: https://twitter.com/PinkDraconian\nDiscord: PinkDraconian<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/9907\">#9907</a>\nWebsite: http://pinkdraconian.d4rkc0de.com/\n\nPlatform: CyberSecLabs\n\nPlatform Link: https://www.cyberseclabs.co.uk/\n\nCategory: Machine\n\nOS: Linux\n\nChallenge name: Lazy\n\nDifficulty: 1/10\n\n\n00:00 Introduction\n00:10 Nmap scan\n00:20 Checking samba version for exploits with searchsploit\n00:40 Reading up on is_known_pipename() exploit\n01:30 Checking if we can use samba without credentials\n02:30 Running the is_known_pipename exploit in metasploit","viewCount":1598,"lengthSeconds":273,"watchProgress":21.402533,"timeWatched":1792063319499,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"AAE3HRFdr2HUYwey","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"t3dOepo9Rz4","title":"Reddington’s Most Brutal Revenge Moments | The Blacklist","author":"FilmIsNow Epic Movie Zone","authorId":"UCmQynT5NWU3Vsa9t0OGUhcA","published":1791053729000,"description":"Raymond Reddington never forgets a betrayal — and when someone crosses him or hurts the people he cares about, his revenge can be absolutely brutal.\nFrom cold-blooded executions and personal betrayals to some of Red’s most ruthless punishments, these are Reddington’s most brutal revenge moments from The Blacklist.\n\n00:00 RESSLER SENDS HIS REGARDS (S2 E10 – The Informant)\n04:27 BETRAYAL HAS A PRICE (S1 E11 – The Good Samaritan)\n06:51 EVER DREAM OF FLYING? (S6 E16 – Lady Luck)\n11:40 FORGIVE ME, KATE (S4 E02 – Mato)\n16:20 ONE LAST DRINK (S2 E08 – The Decembrist)\n21:19 SOMEONE ELSE KNOWS (S1 E13 – The Cyprus Agency)\n24:58 THIS ENDS NOW (S1 E10 –  Anslo Garrick: Conclusion)\n27:24 JUST DOING MY JOB (S6 E14 – The Osterman Umbrella Company)\n\nDirector: Various\nCast: James Spader, Megan Boone, Hisham Tawfiq, Diego Klattenhoff, Harry Lennix\n\nWatch ALL Episodes HERE  ⬇️\nhttp://AAN.SonyPictures.com/TheBlacklist\n\n© Published under license from Sony Pictures Entertainment.\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/theblacklist\">#TheBlacklist</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/reddington\">#Reddington</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/jamesspader\">#JamesSpader</a>\n····················································································\nSUPPORT US!\n💪 Subscribe to our channel http://tinyurl.com/SUB-Extra\n\nMORE CONTENT MUST WATCH! \n► Trending Videos: http://tinyurl.com/TRENDINGVIDEOS-on-FinExtra\n► Best Bloopers: http://tinyurl.com/BESTBLOOPERS-FinExtra\n\nSOCIAL MEDIA\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/filmisnowepic\nX: https://twitter.com/filmisnow\n····················································································\n🎬 Welcome to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/epicmoviezone\">#EpicMovieZon