{"videoId":"zApCD-1LrdA","title":"Prem & Jai Sahaja! – Hara Mahadeva","author":"Mooji Mala Music","authorId":"UCBULR-vqvM3nxHP94KXLL5A","published":1595250757000,"description":"&quot;Hara Mahadeva&quot; (by Samadhi) performed by Prem and Jai Sahaja! \n\nThis uplifting song was performed by Prem and the Jai Sahaja! Bhajans Group in Monte Sahaja for Guru Purnima on 5 July, 2020. Guru Purnima is an auspicious day to honour, celebrate and express our deep gratitude for the immense blessing of the Guru. The word ‘Guru’ has Sanskrit origins, meaning ‘the dispeller of darkness’, and such a one is a light unto this world.\n\nFull concert available on Sahaja Express: https://mooji.tv/subscription\n\nMooji Mala Music emanates from Heart Satsangs with Mooji. \nIt is true soul music that uplifts the spirit and fills the heart with love and joy. Enjoy!\n\nMooji Mala Music:\nOfficial Webpage | https://mooji.org/music\nSpotify | https://spoti.fi/2Py64TP\nApple Music | https://apple.co/2Or9EyJ\nSatsang Shop | https://shop.mooji.org/category/music\n\nMore information about Satsang with Mooji can be found on https://mooji.org/​\n\nTo support these offerings and the worldwide sharing of Satsang, you can donate here: https://mooji.org/donate?tcode=mmm1\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/jaisahaja\">#jaisahaja</a>! <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/moojimalamusic\">#moojimalamusic</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/moojimusic\">#moojimusic</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/moojimala\">#moojimala</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/premmusic\">#premmusic</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/satsongs\">#satsongs</a>","viewCount":1219443,"lengthSeconds":519,"watchProgress":519.381,"timeWatched":1791835433089,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"K6AiqqYkSx1wAhzp","lastViewedPlaylistId":"ft-playlist--94c09a74-e6e1-4784-b28c-84d4e7ea8a0b","lastViewedPlaylistType":"user","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":"f0787e60-cb5c-4b70-a656-5829812bd33b