{"videoId":"_ho2Jn68d9w","title":"Day 478: San Francisco [bicycle nomad]","author":"The Loaded Pickle","authorId":"UCXHO8wBQzaKwgnewkG4BmhQ","published":1792174357000,"description":"noticed the lady was gone before I even finished editing my video this morning, never heard her yell or anything. tried burning time to allow my new cassette to be delivered. slow ride into some trails, going thru some cool sections of the north Bay area. found my Amazon locker and the package wasn&apos;t even out for delivery yet so I tried a few shops. first was was a bar with a tiny work area and they tried arguing with me instead of helping 😆 I eventually found what I needed at Sunshine Bicycle Center and installed it right there. long ride to the bridge from here with LOTS of dumb people. it is to be expected. crossed the bridge, found my motel and got a HOT shower (I swear it&apos;s boiling water in these pipes) and then ordered pizza. long, crazy day.","viewCount":951,"lengthSeconds":1763,"watchProgress":1762.901,"timeWatched":1792177961477,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"KdloKhUzRXxVhK4G","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"DZlXfuRhBDU","title":"Understand Wayland's Source Code in 15 Minutes (No Coding Degree Needed!)","author":"Julia Frank","authorId":"UC0UmeTkwIo0Gyr9HlmXgRbA","published":1732344005000,"description":"Subscribe to my NEWSLETTER: https://juliafrank.net/newsletter/\nBLOG https://juliafrank.net/\n\nDive deep into the architecture of Wayland&apos;s source code as we break down its key components and compare it with X11.  Learn about the client-server model, core protocols, and the fundamental differences that make Wayland what it is today.\n\nWayland architecture images credit: https://wayland.freedesktop.org/architecture.html\n\nWATCH NEXT 🎯\nWhat is Wayland? A Beginner&apos;s Introduction for New Linux Users.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FksHyTvBUNs&pp=0gcJCR0AztywvtLA\nI Learned to Code in My 30s (and You Can Too!) <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/womenwhocode\">#womenwhocode</a> \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qK9wbislre0\n\nTHANKS TO MY LOYAL SUBSCRIBERS!\n🤝 2496🤝","viewCount":16733,"lengthSeconds":989,"watchProgress":464.941556,"timeWatched":1792084824056,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"LFFSumOmr3UcSDkx","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"wj9_gCack68","title":"Install MPV Player: Full Setup & Modern Skin Guide 2026 (Windows)","author":"Learn with Limon","authorId":"UCFnYHxlXp-ut26ClsscZmNw","published":1768511710000,"description":"If you’ve ever wanted a lightweight video player that looks modern and plays almost any file without issues, this video is for you. I’m Limon, and I’ll walk you through how to install MPV Player on Windows and set it up with a modern skin in 2026. We’ll go step by step so you can get everything working smoothly and end up with a clean, stylish player that feels great to use every day.","viewCount":29981,"lengthSeconds":282,"watchProgress":142.473844,"timeWatched":1791933165504,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"Lu6Eh8vQ58cIJNj6","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
