{"videoId":"8P9qqnso5Ro","title":"What Happened to Omarchy in Two Weeks?","author":"LinuxBTW","authorId":"UC0IC-zXPncYZt-lW8EFDQ9w","published":1788177633000,"description":"Omarchy was released in mid August and then the community exploded: 100,000 downloads per week, a new $10 million dollar foundation, sponsored open source projects and artists, and even a potential move to NIX!  \n\nLinks below:\n\nOmarchy Linux: https://omarchy.org/\nOmarchy Plugins: https://plugins.omarchy.org/\nOmarchy Extra Themes: https://omarchy.org/themes/\nOmarchy Meetups: https://luma.com/omarchy\nPortwatch: https://github.com/ZerubbabelT/portwatch\n\nHardware Recommendations:\nBeelink EQi mini PC (Intel Wildcat Lake 304, 16GB RAM; check current price and configuration): https://amzn.to/4vXWBUl\nBenQ RD280UG - my choice for the best monitor in 2026 / 3:2 / 28&quot; / Matte Programming Monitor: https://amzn.to/4hR8qZg\nSamsung 128GB Black USB key - avoid annoying cheap ones: https://amzn.to/3H2ngLX\n\nFastMail for email (not sponsored - I pay for it) because I can use custom domains for all of my projects, and they don&apos;t scan my email for ads.  Use this link to get 10% off and help the channel: https://join.fastmail.com/2972c0bf\n\nTimestamps:\n0:00 Two Weeks With Omarchy 4\n0:25 Omarchy Is Blowing Up\n1:15 The $10 Million Omacon Foundation\n2:17 Funding Hyprland, Quickshell &amp; Mise\n3:04 Paying Artists to Improve Linux\n4:01 The Omarchy Plugin Explosion\n4:26 Installing Plugins\n6:00 My Favorite Omarchy Plugins\n6:29 AirPods on Linux\n6:54 Better Multi-Monitor Controls\n7:38 Tracking AI Usage\n8:24 Audio, Display &amp; Network Controls\n9:22 Why Omarchy Is So Easy to Use\n10:01 Themes &amp; Customization\n10:49 100,000+ Downloads\n11:21 Try Omarchy Without Installing It\n12:26 The AUR Security Problem\n13:09 Omarchy Meetups Everywhere\n13:59 The $600 Linux Laptop Setup\n15:37 Two Weeks Later: My Verdict\n\nDisclaimer: Beelink and Benq hardware provided for review","viewCount":178494,"lengthSeconds":1071,"watchProgress":27.111739,"timeWatched":1791583847338,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"R5wHWB62pKRT5Dz2","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
