{"videoId":"4yqZbWgw3_c","title":"Day 474: fogless frolicking [bicycle nomad]","author":"The Loaded Pickle","authorId":"UCXHO8wBQzaKwgnewkG4BmhQ","published":1791841204000,"description":"woke up to clear skies! had some amazing riding all day, once again. rode aimlessly south, stopping off at a store for a few supplies. dealt with some crummy drivers. eventually found a stealth camp with amazing views! no dinner tonight, just snacks.","viewCount":7380,"lengthSeconds":2211,"watchProgress":2211.341,"timeWatched":1791903892462,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"Zrw2NRtTjaFKdQVD","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"2wrpbTRZSvU","title":"XFCE WILL BE WRITTEN IN RUST!? | Source Code #2","author":"YouTux Channel","authorId":"UCYlMGSxDy8fCQGXesK64aEg","published":1769601605000,"description":"00:00 – Something Just Changed\n00:50 – XFCE Jumps to Rust: Unexpected Turn\n03:31 – Clawbot: Copilot, but on Your Terms\n05:36 – The Kernel Without Linus?\n08:43 – Observing the Shift\n\nIn this special episode of Source Code we look at three signals of deep change in open source:  \nXFCE starting a Rust-based Wayland compositor, the rise of open-source AI coding assistants, and the Linux kernel planning continuity beyond its founders.  \nNot hype. Just observation.\n\nSources:\nXFCE\nhttps://linuxiac.com/xfce-begins-work-on-xfwl4-a-rust-based-wayland-compositor/\nhttps://alexxcons.github.io/blogpost_15.html\n\nClawsbot  https://www.youtube.com/@Techonsapevole \nhttps://github.com/clawdbot/\n\nKernel Plans \nhttps://www.phoronix.com/news/Linux-Kernel-Continuity-Doc","viewCount":8505,"lengthSeconds":584,"watchProgress":73.649994,"timeWatched":1792094527544,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"b7kcXTltWn1RSuaJ","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"PYfGFRj5ffY","title":"Day 473: let's ride! [bicycle nomad]","author":"The Loaded Pickle","authorId":"UCXHO8wBQzaKwgnewkG4BmhQ","published":1791761961000,"description":"lots of amazing riding shots today... beautiful weather all day! tried finding lunch at a couple cafes along the way, didn&apos;t happen. found my campground and didn&apos;t like it. ended up stealth camping near the campground. simple dinner out of a bag today.","viewCount":6840,"lengthSeconds":2147,"watchProgress":4.645226,"timeWatched":1791822916953,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"bgsNO1xkxFI64PHZ","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"Z7ciDB9p3c8","title":"How to Turn Fedora Into a Rolling Release!","author":"OhHeyItsLou","authorId":"UC3qmmCSc7VnbuTyxg94am4Q","published":1424975580000,"description":"In this video I show you the steps necessary to turn Fedora into a rolling release.  This video was demonstrated using Fedora 21.\n\nsudo yum install fedora-repos-rawhide yum-utils\nsudo yum-config-manager --disable fedora updates updates-testing\nsudo yum-config-manager --enable rawhide\nsudo yum --releasever=rawhide distro-sync --nogpgcheck\nsudo yum update yum\n\nAppreciate what I do? Grab me a coffee! http://goo.gl/wmHh4\nTwitter: http://twitter.com/OhHeyItsLou\nFacebook: http://www.facebook.com/OhHeyItsLou\nGoogle+:  google.com/+LouRizzo\nIRC: Freenode <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/youtubelou\">#YouTubeLou</a>\nBlogger: http://ohheyitslou.blogspot.com/\nSteam:  IDIefiant","viewCount":7827,"lengthSeconds":265,"watchProgress":123.40868,"timeWatched":1791751127661,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"c9y7a21vaVgH3Tvz","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"N_phrNKs3PI","title":"Scrolling Window Managers: Greatest Thing Ever Created?","author":"Brodie Robertson","authorId":"UCld68syR8Wi-GY_n4CaoJGA","published":1760977816000,"description":"For a few months I&apos;ve been using the Niri Window manager and it makes use of a scrolling window manager model, but is the model even worth your time?\n\n==========Support The Channel==========\n► Patreon: https://brodierobertson.xyz/patreon\n► Paypal: https://brodierobertson.xyz/paypal\n► Liberapay: https://brodierobertson.xyz/liberapay\n► Amazon USA: https://brodierobertson.xyz/amazonusa\n\n==========Resources==========\nKarousel Repo: https://github.com/peterfajdiga/karousel\nPaperWM Repo: https://github.com/paperwm/PaperWM\nOld Hyprland Plugin: https://github.com/dawsers/hyprscroller \nNew Hyprland Plugin: https://code.hyprland.org/hyprwm/hyprland-plugins/src/branch/main/hyprscrolling\nScroll Repo:  https://github.com/dawsers/scroll\nNiri Repo: https://github.com/YaLTeR/niri\nMacOS Plugin: https://github.com/mogenson/PaperWM.spoon\n\n=========Video Platforms==========\n🎥 Odysee: https://brodierobertson.xyz/odysee\n🎥 Podcast: https://techovertea.xyz/youtube\n🎮 Gaming: https://brodierobertson.xyz/gaming\n\n==========Social Media==========\n🎤 Discord: https://brodierobertson.xyz/discord\n🐦 Twitter: https://brodierobertson.xyz/twitter\n🌐 Mastodon: https://brodierobertson.xyz/mastodon\n🖥️ GitHub: https://brodierobertson.xyz/github\n\n==========Credits==========\n🎨 Channel Art:\nProfile Picture:\nhttps://www.instagram.com/supercozman_draws/\n\n🎵 Ending music\nTrack: Debris &amp; Jonth - Game Time [NCS Release]\nMusic provided by NoCopyrightSounds.\nWatch:  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDTvvOTie0w \nFree Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/GameTime\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linux\">#Linux</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/hyprland\">#Hyprland</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/opensource\">#OpenSource</a> <a href=\"https://www.yo