{"videoId":"P6pcTK0wTYA","title":"How to Switch to Linux","author":"Linus Tech Tips","authorId":"UCXuqSBlHAE6Xw-yeJA0Tunw","published":1793037455000,"description":"Meter is funding the next generation of network engineers with grants of up to $2,000 for courses, certifications, and tools. Apply today: https://meter.com/grants\n\nIf you&apos;ve ever thought about switching to Linux but have been afraid of learning a new operating system, it&apos;s time to stop being afraid! We&apos;re here to tell you how to switch from the clutches of Windows into the vast, open, free sea that is Linux. Don&apos;t be tepid young one, you got this.\n\nDiscuss on the forum: https://linustechtips.com/topic/1643960-how-to-switch-to-linux/\n\nCheck out the LABS article: https://www.lttlabs.com/articles/2026/08/31/a-guide-to-switching-to-linux-and-grieving-windows\n\nCheck out our Channel Partners:\n\nSecretlab \nGrab a TITAN Evo ergonomic gaming chair:  https://lmg.gg/secretlabltt\nGrab an ATLAS ergonomic office chair:  https://lmg.gg/secretlablttatlas\n\nPIA \nGet the VPN of our choice: https://www.piavpn.com/ltt\n\ndbrand \nBuy a &quot;Circuit&quot; series skin for your device: https://dbrand.com/pcb\n\n► SHOP LTT PRODUCTS: https://lttstore.com/\n► GET EXCLUSIVE CONTENT ON FLOATPLANE: https://lmg.gg/lttfloatplane\n► DIVE DEEPER ON THE LTT LABS WEBSITE: https://lmg.gg/labs\n► SPONSORS, AFFILIATES, AND PARTNERS: https://lmg.gg/partners\n\nPurchases made through some store links may provide some compensation to Linus Media Group. Affiliate links powered in part by https://affilimate.com/?aid=ghz1izbpb\n\nLinus Sebastian is an investor in Framework Computer, Inc and HexOS by Eshtek.\n\nCHAPTERS\n---------------------------------------------------\n0:00 Intro\n1:56 Choosing a distro\n3:24 Tools to install Linux\n4:02 Backing up data\n4:38 Installing Linux\n6:02 Where is everything?\n6:36 The file manager\n8:42 Getting apps\n12:20 Drivers\n13:47 YOU DID IT!!\n15:40 Outro","viewCount":1384874,"lengthSeconds":955,"watchProgress":118.892984,"timeWatched":1793129032481,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"in0b2eDXGfCFndK3","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"rtQStIWumsU","title":"How to Bake the Perfect MINI CHOCOFLANS, so simple and perfect EVERYTIME!","author":"Cooking Con Claudia","authorId":"UC0tVWRw4aNoVqXaobA8E_Ig","published":1716245813000,"description":"Hello my beautiful fam!! Welcome to the heart of my home, my kitchen!!!!! 🎉🥺♥️🙏🏽 ❤️ \n\nIt’s another beautiful day and since celebrations are just around the corner, I want to share with you how to make the best MINI CHOCOFLANS it makes the perfect bite size dessert. Now let me tell you I shared with you my original recipe 6 years ago and it’s been a staple in many of your homes, when I first shared this recipe a lot of you didn’t like the way I do it, but let me tell you this gives you a clean separation between the flan and cake and most importantly the cake is not over baked! 😅 ☺️♥️I hope you enjoy it as much as my family and I do, and as always, if you do, please don’t forget to give me a big thumbs up, comment down below your thoughts and if you new to my channel, please hit that subscribe button so you can be part of our family!!!!!! 😘\n\nmy cookbook is NOW AVAILABLE 🥳👉🏽  http://geni.us/CookingConClaudia get a sneak peek and let me know your thoughts ♥️ \n\n🛍ALL OF MY FAVORITE ITEMS/KITCHEN ESSENTIALS CAN BE FOUND ON MY AMAZON STOREFRONT 😊 https://www.amazon.com/shop/claudiasvlogs \n\n🫶🏽♥️ Get your apron here https://cookingconclaudia-shop.fourthwall.com/\n\nPots &amp; pans using atm Ourplace Website - https://glnk.io/r5y0n/cooking-con-claudia \nOven pan - https://go.magik.ly/ml/207ew/\nAlways Pan 2.0 - https://go.magik.ly/ml/1sujs/\nCast Iron - https://glnk.io/mzz79/cooking-con-claudia\nblender- Vitamix A3500\n\n🛑 For any other recipe just type in Cooking Con Claudia, followed by the recipe name you trying to find, if I already made it it should appear as the first videos ☺️ if not, request it in the comments 😘\n\n‼️ make sure not to fill up the muffin cups all the way!! \n\nthis makes 1 whole chocoflan, 12 jumbo muffins or 24 mini \n\nIngredients: \n1/4 cup whipped cream cheese\n5 eggs\n1 evaporated can\n1 condensed can\n1 tbsp Mexican vanilla blend\n1 1/2 cup sugar\n1 triple chocolate fudge cake mix plus ingredients \n1 serving of love 💕 \n\nWant to see more of me and my family? Follow me ☺️ tag me on any recipes you recreate 🥰\nhttps://linktr.ee/cookingconclaudia\nTikTok: www.tiktok.com/@cooking.con.claudia\nIG: cooking_con_claudia\nFb: Cooking with Claudia \nBusiness Inquires Only: claudia.regalado91@gmail.com\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/chocoflan\">#chocoflan</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/impossiblecake\">#impossiblecake</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/bundtcake\">#bundtcake</a>","viewCount":142203,"lengthSeconds":299,"watchProgress":2.999681,"timeWatched":1791987581427,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"js48DBnXhEKJS01s","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
