{"videoId":"SNS_CH_pkF0","title":"Day 476: things happen [bicycle nomad]","author":"The Loaded Pickle","authorId":"UCXHO8wBQzaKwgnewkG4BmhQ","published":1791998146000,"description":"woke up to fog that burned off quick and left me with beautiful riding weather. rode on and on, thru a couple tiny fishing villages and eventually stopped for groceries. rode on and got caught in construction, passed my trailhead and had to u turn to a huge mechanical failure. limped the rig to the campground, tipping the trailer on the way. met some cool people doing a one-night tour and shared a meal with them. awesome day overall.","viewCount":3042,"lengthSeconds":1917,"watchProgress":39.071086,"timeWatched":1792013233669,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"nSRbriFWG5NzZ1VL","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"leMjwPCPe_s","title":"Day 471: coastline cruising [bicycle nomad]","author":"The Loaded Pickle","authorId":"UCXHO8wBQzaKwgnewkG4BmhQ","published":1791566861000,"description":"packed up and it immediately got foggy... go figure. rode in and out of it all day, some amazing views even with the fog. found my camp, nice spot. talked with the park employee for a while and met a couple other bike travelers. had some sun for a few hours! weird tacos for dinner.","viewCount":9419,"lengthSeconds":1381,"watchProgress":1381.201,"timeWatched":1791764214273,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"o8sjq96swhnBHLcv","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"udc-g2Iz-ik","title":"Fedora 45 Is Coming! 🔥 7 BIG Changes You Need to Know","author":"High Tech Zone","authorId":"UCUJzVYpZGs_UeOk553L2gJg","published":1790866835000,"description":"Fedora 45 is coming, and the new Fedora Linux 45 Beta gives us an early look at some BIG changes coming to Linux!\n\nIn this video, we cover 7 major Fedora 45 changes, including GNOME 51, kmscon replacing the traditional Linux kernel console, stronger package signature verification, RPM 6.1, new developer tools, improved Fedora installation media, Anaconda installer changes, oo7 secure key storage, and improvements for Apple Silicon through Fedora Asahi Remix 45.\n\nFedora 45 is currently in Beta, with the final release targeted for October 20, 2026.\n\nIn this video:\n• Fedora 45 Beta\n• GNOME 51\n• Fedora 45 new features\n• kmscon Linux console\n• RPM 6.1\n• Fedora package security\n• Fedora 45 installer changes\n• Anaconda WebUI installer\n• oo7 secure key storage\n• Fedora Asahi Remix 45\n• Apple Silicon Linux\n• Fedora 45 release date\n• Should you try Fedora 45 Beta?\n\nIf you&apos;re interested in Fedora Linux, GNOME, Linux desktop development, Linux security, and the latest Linux distributions, this video covers the most important Fedora 45 changes you need to know.\n\nSubscribe for more Linux news, Linux updates, Fedora, Ubuntu, Linux Mint, GNOME, KDE Plasma and Linux desktop content.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fedora45\">#Fedora45</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fedoralinux\">#FedoraLinux</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linux\">#Linux</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gnome51\">#GNOME51</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fedora\">#Fedora</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fedora45\">#Fedora45</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fedoralinux\">#FedoraLinux</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linux\">#Linux</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gnome51\">#GNOME51</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linuxnews\">#LinuxNews</a>","viewCount":1691,"lengthSeconds":429,"watchProgress":1.951238,"timeWatched":1792018939838,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"oVsTpL7eZVNufMyT","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"sV8dt5Y6GOE","title":"How to Make the BEST Chocoflan At Home!","author":"With Wendy and Shannon","authorId":"UCSSP4z2Pz3i1EaymbqcQDXg","published":1758983450000,"description":"This rich and decadent Chocoflan, often called Impossible Cake, is a showstopper dessert that magically separates into two layers while baking. This Chocoflan features a moist chocolate cake topped with creamy vanilla flan and a rich caramel. It looks impressive, but Chocoflan is easier to make than you think!\n\nFull recipe - https://www.withwendyandshannon.com/post/the-best-chocoflan\n\nIngredients \n\nCaramel\n1 cup sugar\n\nChocolate Cake\n3 large eggs, room temperature\n½ cup vegetable oil\n1 cup milk, room temperature\n1 tsp vanilla extract\n1 box Chocolate Cake Mix\n1 tbsp coffee powder\n⅛ tsp salt\n\nFlan\n4 large eggs, room temperature\n1 can (14 oz) sweetened condensed milk\n1 can (12 oz) evaporated milk\n2 tsp vanilla extract\n______________________________________________\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/withwendyandshannon\">#withwendyandshannon</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/flan\">#flan</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/chocoflan\">#chocoflan</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/platinitwithwendy\">#platinitwithwendy</a> \n\nSubscribe for a peek into our world—always shared with heart, humour, and style. Follow us on social media and stay connected! https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSSP4z2Pz3i1EaymbqcQDXg\nCheck out more recipes - https://linktr.ee/withwendyandshannon","viewCount":67571,"lengthSeconds":481,"watchProgress":4.499971,"timeWatched":1792024688454,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"olRaooQWgvLDiuhR","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"VzRZG_NEeLk","title":"The CEO Who Fired An Abusive Kitchen Manager On The Spot | Undercover Boss Usa","author":"Undercover Boss","authorId":"UCIVWVtEQIS_oaRIG19e_zsA","published":1788810314000,"description":"During a shift in Bardstown, Kentucky, Buffalo Wings &amp; Rings CEO Nater Masreh encounters kitchen manager Wes, who relies on verbal abuse, intimidation, and fear to control his young high school staff. Disturbed by the severe bullying and toxic work culture behind the line, Nater is forced to halt the operation and address the breakdown in leadership.\n\nConfronting the franchise owner and manager directly, Nater exposes the unacceptable behavior taking place in the kitchen. Realizing the damage done to his team&apos;s safety and morale, the store owner makes the immediate decision to terminate the abusive manager on the spot.\n\nFull episodes and highlights from Undercover Boss, featuring CEOs and executives going undercover to work alongside their employees, uncover workplace challenges, and make life-changing decisions. Watch authentic moments, emotional reveals, and behind-the-scenes transformations from businesses across different industries. New clips and full segments uploaded regularly.\n\nWatch every episode of Undercover Boss 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLd2jXOFLg04mgSHYZPzDrIbQlAQVX1fio\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/undercoverboss\">#UndercoverBoss</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/realitytv\">#RealityTV</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/business\">#Business</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/ceo\">#CEO</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/workplace\">#Workplace</a>","viewCount":9700080,"lengthSeconds":2054,"watchProgress":213.376841,"timeWatched":1792086879112,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"onrQiy09qHmbj5W8","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"4rpwFJWTusY","title":"I Wish Someone Explained Linux Distros Like This","author":"Zeroes&Ones","authorId":"UCeEnDplClAX5-0X96kf49Sw","published":1793116917000,"description":"In this video, I will Linux distros for absolute beginners to Linux! So if you&apos;re confused about all these Linux distros and want to know what they are and where they come from but are still confused then don&apos;t worry, because I&apos;ll explain Linux distros for absolute beginners in a way that is completely understandable!\n\n🫂 Mastodon: https://mastodon.social/@zeroesandones\n\n💎 If you found value in my work, and would like to support me, the links are here! \nhttps://buymeacoffee.com/zeroesandones\nhttps://ko-fi.com/zeroesandones \n\n🐧 Software I use to make these videos (all open source): \n1. Drawy (for the drawing stuff I do): https://apps.kde.org/en-gb/drawy/ \n2. Kdenlive (video editor): https://kdenlive.org/\n\n🌐 Websites Mentioned:\nhttps://fedoraproject.org/\nLTT video w/ Linus: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mfv0V1SxbNA\nhttps://www.redhat.com/en/technologies/linux-platforms/enterprise-linux\nhttps://rpmfusion.org/FAQ#RPM_Fusion\nhttps://discuss.cachyos.org/t/aur-compromised-almost-2000-packages-affected-20260611/31040\nhttps://cybersecuritynews.com/arch-linux-aur-packages-compromised/\nhttp://www.slackware.com/info/\nhttps://ultramarine-linux.org/\nhttps://nobaraproject.org/\nhttps://bazzite.gg/\nhttps://voidlinux.org/\nhttps://www.gentoo.org/\n\n📑 Chapters:\n00:00 - Intro!\n00:14 - What&apos;s a &quot;Linux distro&quot;?\n02:15 - Why so MANY distros?\n03:13 - Arch Linux Family\n05:58 - Debian Linux Family\n08:27 - Red Hat Family\n12:21 - SUSE Family\n15:51 - Independent distros\n18:14 - What&apos;s an IMMUTABLE distro?\n19:08 - What distro should YOU use?\n20:00 - My distro recommendation\n20:28 - Bye, bye, everyone!\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linuxforbeginners\">#linuxforbeginners</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linuxdistro\">#linuxdistro</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/linux\">#linux</a>","viewCount":622,"lengthSeconds":1267,"watchProgress":1267.066484,"timeWatched":1793129183931,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"oss3NZdJHVKu3Ky3","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
