{"videoId":"61VavjX6ZrI","title":"🔴Struggling with Chocoflan or Impossible Cake? Step-by-Step Guide | Easy No-Bake Recipe!!","author":"El sabor latino","authorId":"UCGzKV5MYIcPDfogr--h0WxQ","published":1648505030000,"description":"💥Chocoflan or Impossible Cake Recipe - Having trouble getting it right? I&apos;ll guide you step-by-step so it turns out delicious! It&apos;s an easy and incredibly tasty recipe, no oven required, cooked in a water bath on the stovetop with the exact cooking time. The cake comes out soft and fluffy, and the flan is so creamy it melts in your mouth. I hope you like it and make it! It&apos;s ideal for birthdays 🎂, parties, events, gatherings, or simply for a family treat.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/chocoflan\">#chocoflan</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/impossiblecake\">#impossiblecake</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/howtomakehomemadechocoflan\">#howtomakehomemadechocoflan</a>\n\nChocoflan, Impossible Cake, a delicious dessert to enjoy. It tastes and is better than your favorite store-bought version, and it&apos;s more economical.\n\nI invite you to subscribe to this channel for Easy and Delicious Recipes, Latin Flavor. Activate the notification bell so you receive all the recipes.\n\nWe thank all the wonderful people who have subscribed and are subscribing every day. Thank you so much! We send you a big hug. 👇👇💖\nhttps://youtube.com/c/Elsaborlatinosaboratumesa\nFacebook💖\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Elsaborlatinosaboratumesa/\nInstagram💖\nhttps://www.instagram.com/elsaborlatinosaboratumesa?r=nam\n\nItems on sale with great savings\n⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️\nhttps://beacons.ai/elsaborlatino\n\n\n\n\n💥INGREDIENTS FOR 8-12 PEOPLE💥\n\n1 8oz (226g) bar of cream cheese\n1 354g can of sweetened condensed milk\n1 350ml can of evaporated milk\nA splash of vanilla extract\n5 eggs\n\n1 box of chocolate cake mix\n3 eggs\n1/2 cup (125ml) of vegetable oil\n1 1/4 cups (315ml) of water\n\n9&quot; or 10&quot; non-stick round cake pan, 5-6&quot; deep.\n\n💥RECOMMENDED RECIPES💥\n\n💥 Delicious Capirotada (Mexican Bread Pudding)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hyJTpLS5aK8\n\n💥Chicharron in Green Sauce\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UCj6VjBaBro\n\n💥Breaded Shrimp 👌🦐\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLYMqtH0PQQ\n\n💥Delicious Green Chilaquiles\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ABRunX6-opI\n\n💥Governor Tacos, Shrimp Tacos\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZa0d2N-Da4\n\n💥White Rice with Vegetables\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XjwZbwgxAco\n\n💥Delicious Red Shrimp Aguachile\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_lUI7SrS0BY\n\n💥Easy and Delicious Tuna Croquettes\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sNCZvTaezf4\n\n💥Delicious Spicy Shrimp\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KOb6mdYW-qY\n\n💥Delicious Cheese-Stuffed Chiles Delicious\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N1GL74vH_ko\n\n💥 Delicious Fish Broth\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EKFcJY_DFAE\n\n💥 Meatball Broth 👌\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pAOP1YCo910\n\n💥 Amazing Rajas and Cheese Tamales\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VsPO18EWDjk\n\n💥 Delicious Stuffed Zucchini\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=REyE_8CggiQ\n\n💥 Delicious Beef Stew\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0vso0VBnna4\n\n💥 Nutritious Chicken and Vegetable Shell Soup\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zpiDUtTxqnQ\n\n💥 Easy and Delicious\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sGdNCELfs6Y\n\n💥How to Make Homemade Queso Fresco\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tjP9YmbPf5w\n\n💥Delicious Stuffed Eggplant\n\n💥Red Pork Tamales\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G57R3gtO9Xw\n\n💥How to Make Oaxacan Tamales in Banana Leaves\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1ATTKQCC0iU\n\n💥Chicken Barbacoa\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wj6GLlqcysI\n\n💥How to Make Delicious Quesabirrias\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hkGsgZqkvlk\n\n💥Orange Chicken\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_au9LPD4a68\n\n💥3 Spaghetti Recipes 👌\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kr3YNYIlbPc\n\n💥 Chicken Broth in Red Chile Sauce\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=608PmXrj1IA&pp=0gcJCR0AztywvtLA\n\n💥 Apple Pie 🍎\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fGauAl4R9hg\n\n💥 Delicious Poached Eggs\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-gAFz2kk11U\n\n💥 Filet Mignon: A Recipe to Fall in Love With\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G-XjNy9-8fM&pp=0gcJCR0AztywvtLA\n\n🔴 Chicken Broth in Red Chile Sauce\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=608PmXrj1IA\n\n🔴 Fish Quesadillas\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zv9Ietgw3rU\n\n🔴 Stuffed Eggplants Chicken\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DKYPX3nhpCs\n\n🔴 Tuna Salad\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mCaTTogg0p8\n\n🔴 Shrimp and Octopus Cocktail\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-GdHsauPo_M\n\n🔴 Grilled Octopus\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g9JwfCFVisI\n\n🔴 Delicious Walnut Cake\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lOKwclPOf7U\n\n🔴 Creamy White Spaghetti\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bIwWGEZCT2w\n\n🔴 Creamy Mashed Potatoes\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=02xaxwd1yTw\n\nEasy Cooking Recipes\nMexican Cuisine\nEasy Recipes\nRanch Recipes Straight to Your Kitchen\nLatin Flavor Recipes\nLent Recipes\nLent","viewCount":1065500,"lengthSeconds":509,"watchProgress":509.321,"timeWatched":1792026253341,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"qQIcI2Msr0Bz4d5c","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
{"videoId":"sMllOlxVgD0","title":"Brian Kernighan: Inside Bell Labs, The Best Programmer, Why C Won","author":"Ryan Peterman","authorId":"UCzB7YGrrxDC_POenf86H3_Q","published":1793019617000,"description":"Brian Kernighan is a former Bell Labs member of technical staff, co-author of the original C book, and the one who popularized “Hello World.” We talked about what Bell Labs was like and the stories behind all the famous tools that were built there.\n\n• My ergonomic keyboard project I mentioned, you can follow along here: https://read.compose.llc/\n• The Kickstarter page for it: https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/ryanlpeterman/compose-simple-ergonomics-beautifully-done\n\n𝗣𝗼𝗱𝗰𝗮𝘀𝘁 𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗸𝘀:\n\n• Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/episode/2yb6snndxGuhBJUGEUx39i\n• Apple: https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-peterman-pod/id1777363835\n• Transcript: https://www.developing.dev/p/e072-brian-kernighan\n\n𝗧𝗵𝗮𝗻𝗸 𝘆𝗼𝘂 𝘁𝗼 𝘁𝗵𝗶𝘀 𝗲𝗽𝗶𝘀𝗼𝗱𝗲&apos;𝘀 𝘀𝗽𝗼𝗻𝘀𝗼𝗿 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝘀𝘂𝗽𝗽𝗼𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗺𝘆 𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗸:\n\n• WorkOS: makes your app Enterprise Ready with easy to use APIs to add SSO, SCIM, RBAC, and more in just a few lines of code, check them out at https://workos.com/\n\n𝗧𝗶𝗺𝗲𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗺𝗽𝘀:\n\n00:00 Intro\n00:42 What Bell Labs was and how he got hired\n06:34 Why so many inventions came from Bell Labs\n14:15 A day in the life at Bell Labs\n27:55 The most impressive people he worked with\n33:50 The AT&amp;T film explaining Unix\n39:46 Why C was so influential\n43:25 How awk was created\n48:40 What he misses most about Bell Labs\n54:10 Are LLMs bad for computer science education\n01:01:46 His 1972 commit in the Go repo\n01:03:43 Grace Emlen, the fake Bell Labs employee\n01:07:39 Why he writes so many books\n01:19:58 His favorite and least favorite languages\n01:24:28 Advice for students and young people\n01:27:42 Outro\n\n𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗿𝗲 𝘁𝗼 𝗳𝗶𝗻𝗱 𝗕𝗿𝗶𝗮𝗻:\n\n• Personal website: https://www.cs.princeton.edu/~bwk/\n• Princeton University faculty profile: https://www.cs.princeton.edu/people/profile/bwk\n• Wikipedia: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brian_Kernighan\n\n𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗿𝗲 𝘁𝗼 𝗳𝗶𝗻𝗱 𝗥𝘆𝗮𝗻:\n\n• Newsletter: https://www.developing.dev/\n• X/Twitter: https://x.com/ryanlpeterman\n• LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ryanlpeterman/\n• Threads: https://www.threads.com/@ryanlpeterman\n• Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/ryanlpeterman\n• TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@ryanlpeterman\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗳𝗲𝗿𝗲𝗻𝗰𝗲𝗱 𝗶𝗻 𝘁𝗵𝗶𝘀 𝗲𝗽𝗶𝘀𝗼𝗱𝗲:\n\n• UNIX: Making Computers Easier to Use: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XvDZLjaCJuw\n• Brian Kernighan’s first Harvard CS50 lecture (1996): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6Ba1XFVy7qw&pp=0gcJCR0AztywvtLA\n• A Beautiful Mind: https://www.universalpicturesathome.com/movies/a-beautiful-mind\n• Shifts: Important Ideas in Computing: https://www.amazon.com/Shifts-Nine-Ideas-Revolutionized-Computing/dp/0262064294/\n• Labscam (Penn &amp; Teller at Bell Labs, 1989): https://www.nokia.com/bell-labs/about/dennis-m-ritchie/labscam.html\n• Labscam video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qnsmDNamd2g\n• Understanding the Digital World (new edition): https://www.amazon.com/Understanding-Digital-World-Computers-Internet/dp/0691288879","viewCount":44953,"lengthSeconds":5318,"watchProgress":151.224551,"timeWatched":1793126681026,"isLive":false,"type":"video","_id":"uj7uiBER1rI7igbA","lastViewedPlaylistType":"","lastViewedPlaylistItemId":null}
